---
// 찾아오시는 길: 작업장 앞 사진, 주소·영업시간, 지도 앱 링크, 지도.
// 네이버·카카오 지도에 가게가 아직 등록되지 않아 주소 검색 화면으로 연결합니다 (src/data/shop.ts의 MAP_LINKS).
import { Icon } from 'astro-icon/components';
import Image from '~/components/common/Image.astro';
import OpenStatus from '~/components/common/OpenStatus.astro';
import { MAP_LINKS, mapEmbed, shopFor } from '~/data/shop';
import { langFromPath, useT } from '~/i18n';

const lang = langFromPath(Astro.url.pathname);
const v = useT(lang).visit;
const shop = shopFor(lang);

const mapLinks = [
  { href: MAP_LINKS.naver, text: v.naver },
  { href: MAP_LINKS.kakao, text: v.kakao },
  { href: MAP_LINKS.google, text: v.google },
];
// 외국어 페이지에서는 구글 지도를 먼저
if (lang !== 'ko') mapLinks.unshift(mapLinks.pop()!);
---

<section id="visit" class="px-5 py-20 md:py-28 lg:px-8" aria-labelledby="visit-title">
  <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_1.1fr] lg:gap-16">
    <div data-reveal>
      <div class="frame"><div class="inner wipe aspect-[6/5]">
        <Image
          src="~/assets/images/works/chowol-04.jpg"
          alt={v.storeAlt}
          widths={[480, 720, 960]}
          sizes="(max-width: 1023px) 100vw, 560px"
          width={960}
          height={800}
          layout="cover"
          format="webp"
          class="parallax h-full w-full object-cover"
        />
      </div></div>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h2 id="visit-title" class="display text-[clamp(2.2rem,4.8vw,3.8rem)] text-ink" data-split>{v.title}</h2>
      <dl class="mt-8 grid gap-6">
        <div>
          <dt class="text-[0.95rem] font-bold text-verm">{v.address}</dt>
          <dd class="display mt-1 text-[1.55rem] leading-snug text-ink">{shop.address}</dd>
          <dd class="mt-1 text-muted">{v.sign}</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt class="text-[0.95rem] font-bold text-verm">{v.hours}</dt>
          <dd class="display mt-1 text-[1.55rem] text-ink">{shop.hours}</dd>
          <dd class="text-muted">{shop.closed}</dd>
          <dd class="mt-3"><OpenStatus /></dd>
        </div>
      </dl>
      <ul class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
        {
          mapLinks.map((link) => (
            <li>
              <a href={link.href} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn-line !min-h-11 !px-5 text-[0.95rem]">
                <Icon name="tabler:map-pin" class="h-5 w-5" aria-hidden="true" />
                {link.text}
              </a>
            </li>
          ))
        }
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="frame mx-auto mt-12 max-w-7xl">
    <iframe
      title={v.mapTitle}
      src={mapEmbed(lang)}
      class="block h-[22rem] w-full border-0 bg-[#d9cdb5] grayscale-[35%] sepia-[15%] md:h-[26rem]"
      loading="lazy"
      referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade"></iframe>
  </div>
</section>
